{"items":[{"path":"tools.lotus.lotus_status","description":"Report LOTUS frontend (headless/windowed), protocol, session tree, cards, approved asset handles, limits and the window workspace layout (workspace.available is false headless).","signature":"tools.lotus.lotus_status(): Promise<unknown>"},{"path":"tools.lotus.lotus_workspace","description":"Read or change what the LOTUS window shows (lotus#72), the same workspace the person changes in the window. operation.op: get (read-only), tile (two different sessions; axis auto/horizontal/vertical, ratio 0.2-0.8, screens per tile), single, untile (keep one), swap, set_axis, set_ratio, set_screen_layout, focus_viewport (keyboard target). A change commits all or nothing and returns the new revision; with expected_revision it is refused if the workspace changed since. Presentation only: never starts, stops or reconfigures a worker, the inspector target, audio focus or controllers. Changes need control permission. Headless: get reports available=false and every change fails as Unsupported.","signature":"tools.lotus.lotus_workspace({
